    "explanation": "Emergent curriculum develops from children's sustained interests, questions, and working theories. Teachers document what they notice, judge its learning potential, and intentionally add materials, knowledge, participation structures, and assessment. It is not improvised aimlessness or following every passing preference; professional goals and children's inquiry are brought into a responsive plan.",
    "explanationZh": "生成课程从儿童持续表现出的兴趣、问题和初步解释出发。教师通过观察记录判断其学习潜力，再有意识地加入材料、知识、参与安排与评价。它不是随意发挥，也不是追随每个短暂偏好，而是让专业教育目标与儿童真实探究共同进入可调整的计划。"
