    "explanation": "Pedagogical content knowledge is the specialised knowledge used to turn particular subject matter into representations, examples, tasks, and questions that specific learners can understand. It includes awareness of common difficulties and misconceptions. Deep subject expertise does not automatically produce effective teaching; educators also need to know how learners interpret the topic and what experiences can change that interpretation.",
    "explanationZh": "学科教学知识是把具体学科内容转化成特定学习者能够理解的表示、案例、任务与问题的专门知识，也包括对常见困难和错误观念的认识。深厚学科知识并不会自动产生有效教学；教师还需知道学习者如何理解这一内容，以及什么经验能促使理解改变。"
