    "explanation": "A therapeutic alliance consists of shared goals, agreed tasks, and a collaborative bond of trust and respect. It requires continuing review, and misaligned goals, unclear tasks, or relational ruptures can be addressed through acknowledgement and repair. It is not friendship and cannot constitute adequate treatment alone. Competence, evidence, boundaries, consent, and safety remain necessary, while alliance shapes participation, persistence, and how treatment is implemented together.",
    "explanationZh": "治疗联盟由共同目标、商定任务以及信任与尊重的合作联结构成。联盟需要持续检查，目标错位、任务不明或关系受伤时，可通过承认和修复恢复合作。它不是友谊，也不能单独构成充分治疗；专业能力、证据、边界、同意与安全仍然必要，但联盟会影响参与、坚持和治疗如何被共同实施。"
